      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CITYWIDE present Apt 37 Park Crescent, Blackhorse Ave, a great size ground floor 2 bedroom apartment, in a desirable residential setting in Dublin 7.\n\nThis apartment comprises of an entrance hallway, open plan living / dining area with kitchen to the side, 2x bedrooms and a bathroom. The apartment has an assigned carparking space in the development, with guest visitor carparking also provided.\n\nOn entering the apartment, the entrance hallway leads through to the bright and spacious \nopen plan living / dining area. With the ideal south-west facing orientation, the large windows look out onto the gardens of the development, with the greenery of the adjoining Phoenix Park behind, there is an almost sylvanian feeling to the setting.\nA covered outdoor terrace / balcony is accessed via the living area and is a fabulous extension to the living space in warmer summer months, with the orientation getting great natural light throughout the day and into the evening too.\n\nThe kitchen is located off the living area, with a part glazed partition and both spaces could be reconfigured, if desired, to create an airy dual aspect open plan space.\n\nThe kitchen has fitted cabinets and freestanding appliances, with ample storage and countertop space provided.\n\nThe primary bedroom is a spacious room and has the same desirable south-west facing orientation as the living area. \n2nd bedroom is another great size bedroom, and could suit a variety of uses, including a home office or guest bedroom. \nThe bathroom is part-tiled, with a shower fitted over the bath.\n\nThe flooring throughout the apartment is carpet, with a practical floor covering in the kitchen. \n\nThe heating throughout the apartment is gas-fired central heating, with gas boiler located in a hotpress in the kitchen.\n\nManagement Company Fee: 1,900 / Annum (2026)\n\n\nFLOOR AREAS\nLiving Area 4.64m x 3.36m\nKitchen 2.32m x 3.36m\nPrimary Bedroom 3.24m x 3.65m\nBedroom Two 2.47m x 3.88m\nBathroom 1.47m x 2.57m\n+ Hallway\n\nTotal Floor Area: 60.8m2 / 655 sq ft\n\n\nLOCATION\nPark Crescent is a small mature residential apartment development located on Blackhorse Ave, adjoining the Phoenix Park. An ideal combination of quiet leafy setting, while having excellent accessibility to the City and surrounding areas.\n\nWithin walking distance of Stoneybatter, Phibsborough, Smithfield and the north city centre, the location is also an excellent distance from the city for a cycle commute. The area benefits from a variety of public transport links, with Pelletstown Train Station a 20min / 1.6km walk from the property. This station is on the Dublin-Maynooth / M3 Parkway Line and currently served by 94 trains a week. The footbridge at the station also provides access to the Royal Canal Greenway and Ashington Park on the opposite side of the canal.\n\nBlackhorse Ave has great accessibility to N3 / Navan Road towards Blanchardstown, and M50 / Airport. The property is in close proximity to numerous local amenities on both Blackhorse Ave and the Navan Road and including a large Tesco Superstore, Lidl, variety of retail and coffee shops.\n\n\nVIEWING IS HIGHLY RECOMMENDED & VIA CITYWIDE \n\n(These particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. CITYWIDE will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein.)\n"
      },
